<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Computer Products upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Computer Products upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nutmeg Securities said it upgraded Computer Products Inc to short-term strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- long-term rating was kept at market outperform.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1/2 to 17.</p>
</text>
